//! task: fix
//! ask: Declare a wire struct with one u32 field.
//! expect: EXS-E0321
//! refs: §5.2
//! explain: An unannotated multi-byte field in a `@transitus` type is `:nativus`, the in-process byte order, which is illegal on the wire. Say which order the wire uses: `u32:maior` for big-endian, `u32:minor` for little-endian.

@transitus
publica structura Capitulum {
    a: u32
}
//@ fixed
@transitus
publica structura Capitulum {
    a: u32:maior
}
